    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Gem3F Valley passed the turn with 8 lands available and two copies of Wan Shi Tong in hand, missing the opportunity to deploy a large flying threat with card draw while still holding up countermagic. The opponent has no creatures on board, so there's minimal risk, and Wan Shi Tong for X=4 (5/5 flyer, draw 2) with Spell Pierce or Spell Snare backup would be a powerful, protected clock.",
