    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gem3F Valley passed with 8 lands available and no creatures on the opponent's board to pressure them, missing the opportunity to deploy Wan Shi Tong, Librarian at end of turn. With X=3 (paying 3UU), they could flash in a 4/4 flyer with vigilance and draw 1 card, establishing a clock and card advantage. The opponent has no board presence (only lands and enchantments), so there's minimal risk. Alternatively, they could activate Fountainport to create a Fish token or Treasure as a mana sink. Passing with all that mana unused wastes tempo.",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority without casting anything or activating any abilities.",
