    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Played Undercity Sewers which enters tapped instead of Gloomlake Verge which would enter untapped (they control Islands and Swamps). This costs 1 available mana this turn for a marginal surveil 1. Given they have countermagic in hand (Spell Snare, Spell Pierce), having maximum mana available is important for flexibility.",
