    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Discarding Spell Pierce instead of an excess land when already at 8 lands on the battlefield. While Spell Pierce gets weaker in the late game as opponents can pay {2} more easily, it still has some utility against Archdruid's Charm or other noncreature spells. Extra lands beyond 8 provide essentially no value.",
