      "decision_index": 305,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "With Icetill Explorer in hand (which allows playing lands from the graveyard), discarding a Forest instead of Llanowar Elves would effectively make the discard free - the Forest could be replayed from the graveyard later. Llanowar Elves, while low-impact with 7+ lands in play, is permanently lost when discarded and represents a body that can attack/block.",
