    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Playing a tapped land (Undercity Sewers) when untapped alternatives like Gloomlake Verge or Swamp were available. With Feed the Cycle in hand and potential need for instant-speed interaction, having more untapped mana is preferable. The surveil 1 is marginal value compared to mana flexibility.",
